  "details": "I think AI textures are OK, as long as they are not Art meant to be seen.\n\nAs well as Text meant to be read, it should not be AI.\n\nMany Users would be tremendously happy if these 2 kinds of AI generated content were to be disallowed in the TOS of VRChat.\n\nremoving those 2 uses of AI will be like switching from Fiverr to Vgen (creators will understand)\n\n3 More reasons↓\n\nit is very sad to see groups with AI Generated banner, AI Generated description, and AI Generated rules, be among the most populated instances without actual staff members.\n\nIt is very disappointing to see AI Generated art on a world thumbnail, click on it, and find out it is either a prefab or a low effort publishing.\n\nit is very weird and annoying to see AI Generated art in paintings that could be filled with actual Art.",
